      "C": "The parallel sides $16\\,\\mathrm{cm}$ and $10\\,\\mathrm{cm}$ are produced by the area formula.",
      "D": "Area $= (16 + 10) \\div (2 \\times 6) = 2.17\\,\\mathrm{cm}^{2}$."
